# {{CLIENT}} reference pack — `_md/`

Derived markdown conversion of the raw client-supplied materials. Originals live one level up
in their own folders and are **never edited**; everything here is generated.

**Read order:** this README → `00_REFERENCE_SUMMARY.md` (facts) → `01_REFERENCE_INSIGHTS.md`
(interpretation) → the per-topic source MD (only when you need to quote).

## Conversion conventions
- **One MD per source file**, in the matching `NN_<topic>/` folder, with `## Page N:` /
  `## Slide N:` anchors so any claim downstream can cite `file.md §Page 12`.
- **Header on each MD:** source path, page/slide count, date shared, author/origin if known,
  CONFIDENTIAL marker if applicable.
- **Tables** rendered as markdown tables; captions written from surrounding text.

## Image / OCR rule (lossless)
Every image triaged into one bucket:
- `[decorative]` → deleted (logos, borders, backgrounds).
- `[content]` → kept as a captioned PNG under `images/<topic>/`.
- `[uncertain]` → OCR'd inline into a `<details><summary>OCR extracted text</summary>…</details>`
  block, then retagged `[ocr-done]`. Never delete an `[uncertain]` image before its text is captured.

